{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45071","headline":"喜义兴权明府自君山至集陆处士羽青塘别业 · 皎然","name":"喜义兴权明府自君山至集陆处士羽青塘别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"应难久辞秩，暂寄君阳隐。\n已见县名花，会逢闱是粉。\n本自寻人至，宁因看竹引。\n身关白云多，门占春山尽。\n最赏无事心，篱边钓溪近。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}